{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EnsemblesCloudKit\/documentation\/EnsemblesCloudKit","doc:\/\/EnsemblesCloudKit\/documentation\/EnsemblesCloudKit\/CloudKitFileSystem"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"EnsemblesCloudKit"}],"title":"setLocalStoreDirectory(_:discardingExistingCache:)","externalID":"s:17EnsemblesCloudKit0bC10FileSystemC22setLocalStoreDirectory_23discardingExistingCacheySSSg_SbtF","extendedModule":"EnsemblesCloudKit","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setLocalStoreDirectory","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"discardingExistingCache","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"method"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Binds the listing cache to the event store’s directory, loading any cache already","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written there for this zone. Called by the ensemble before priming.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ensemblescloudkit\/cloudkitfilesystem\/setlocalstoredirectory(_:discardingexistingcache:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setLocalStoreDirectory","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"path","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"discardingExistingCache","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","